{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a tabletop adventure should feel exciting, not chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MITHOS keeps your tools organized and your focus where it belongs; on the story and your players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to streamline live sessions, it replaces the clutter of tabs, notes, and apps with a single intuitive space. No matter the system or setting, it helps you stay present, react quickly, and keep the game moving smoothly from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your world alive and your attention on the table. Let MITHOS handle the rest.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990740?t=1761838881","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3990740?t=1761838881","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990740/ff3a21c105284bc8c391c976575b191f4231fbae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761838881","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990740/ff3a21c105284bc8c391c976575b191f4231fbae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761838881","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a tabletop adventure should feel exciting, not chaotic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MITHOS keeps your tools organized and your focus where it belongs; on the story and your players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built to streamline live sessions, it replaces the clutter of tabs, notes, and apps with a single intuitive space. No matter the system or setting, it helps you stay present, react quickly, and keep the game moving smoothly from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your world alive and your attention on the table. Let MITHOS handle the rest.</p>","developers":["